WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:04.110
What happens to the movie "John Wick" when
it's run through The Clockworks?

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:09.540
One Blu-ray copy of John Wick was placed into
SCP-914 on the setting "Very Fine," and the

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:13.849
output produced was an animated miniature
figurine of the character John Wick.

00:00:13.849 --> 00:00:18.760
After emerging from the output chamber, the
tiny John Wick attacked Intern Reid, resulting

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:19.760
in his death.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:23.359
He then fought security in a battle that resulted
in three casualties.

00:00:23.359 --> 00:00:27.160
The entity escaped the testing chamber, and
is currently unaccounted for.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:31.470
"Note: Why would anyone think that "John Wick"
on Very Fine was not going to result in a

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:32.910
fatality?

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:33.620
- Intern Sora"

